RESPONSIVE SYSTEM
33. Breakpoints
Recommended:
- Desktop: >= 1024px
- Tablet: 768–1023px
- Mobile: < 768px
Also check orientation.
Do not rely on width alone.
34. Touch Detection
const showTouchControls =
  isMobile ||
  isTablet ||
  navigator.maxTouchPoints > 0;
Keyboard/gamepad desktop:
- hide touch controls
Touch tablet/mobile:
- show touch controls
35. Safe Areas
Support:
- iPhone notch
- Dynamic Island
- Android display cutouts
- browser bottom bars
padding-top:
  max(8px, env(safe-area-inset-top));

padding-left:
  max(8px, env(safe-area-inset-left));

padding-right:
  max(8px, env(safe-area-inset-right));

padding-bottom:
  max(8px, env(safe-area-inset-bottom));
Canvas stays edge-to-edge.
HUD respects safe areas.
36. Fullscreen
On race start, attempt fullscreen when supported:
document.documentElement.requestFullscreen?.();
Do not depend on fullscreen permission.
The layout must still work correctly in mobile Safari without fullscreen.
