38. Typography
Minimum recommended values:
- micro label: 10–11px
- secondary HUD: 12–13px
- HUD value: 20–32px
- control label: 13–16px
- Position: 30–40px
- Speed: 25–34px
Never shrink text just to force it into a card.
39. Animation
Use restrained feedback:
- Boost ready → subtle pulse
- Damage → short red flash
- Position change → number transition
- Item acquired → icon pop
- Checkpoint → short cyan success burst
- Speed → smooth interpolation
Do not animate every border continuously.
PERFORMANCE
40. Mobile Graphics Scaling
Reduce rendering cost dynamically.
High-end:
- DPR max 2
Mid-range:
- DPR ~1.5
Low-end:
- DPR 1.0–1.25
Also scale:
- shadows
- particles
- reflections
- bloom
- post-processing
Do not render desktop-quality pixel density on every phone.
41. React HUD Performance
Do not rerender the entire HUD every frame.
Fast-changing:
- speed
- hull
- shield
- boost
Slow-changing:
- lap
- position
- checkpoint
- item
Static:
- logo
- controls layout
- menus
Use memoized components/selectors and event-based updates.
